# The Gardener release test/gardener.py provisions a node with: its node-agent image (the
# index digest of the release's tag, so both arches) and, rendered from that release,
# test/gardener-init.sh. Not a package: nothing of it is in an image.
#
# Bumped, digest and render together, by `./tools/check-gardener.py bump <version>`; the
# nightly update workflow proposes it, and the gardener CI job runs `verify`.
VERSION="v1.154.6"
NODE_AGENT_DIGEST="sha256:4706369040b1fa551549e05d3f85c2c651ed3f486ea079f80c7e064aceb425e6"
